<li>&lt;a href="sabun"&gt;sabun&lt;/a&gt; mandi.</li>
<li>biang &lt;a href="parfum"&gt;parfum&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="pelembab"&gt;pelembab&lt;/a&gt; tubuh.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="lenga"&gt;lenga&lt;/a&gt; aroma terapi.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Cara Gunakaké</h2>
Cara Gunakaké.
Kanggo ngredakaké stres, nikmati 1-2 cangkir &lt;a href="teh"&gt;teh&lt;/a&gt; godhong kemangi. Carané: 10-15 helai godhong kemangi direndhem ing banyu umup kanthi kurang luwih 5 menit, saring, banjur disajikaké.
