<doc id="35750" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=35750" title="Salman Khan">
Salman Khan

Abdul Rashid Salim Salman Khan (&lt;a href="Hindi"&gt;Hindi&lt;/a&gt;: सलमान ख़ान, &lt;a href="Urdu"&gt;Urdu&lt;/a&gt;: سلمان خان, [səlˈmɑːn ˈxɑːn]; lair &lt;a href="27%20Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;27 Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1965"&gt;1965&lt;/a&gt;) iku aktor filem &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; sing misuwur ing fim-filem &lt;a href="Bollywood"&gt;Bollywood&lt;/a&gt;.
Khan, sing miwiti karir ing filem &lt;a href="Biwi%20Ho%20To%20Aisi"&gt;Biwi Ho To Aisi&lt;/a&gt; (1988), ngrengkuh suksès sing sepisanan sajeroning filem blockbuster &lt;a href="Maine%20Pyar%20Kiya"&gt;Maine Pyar Kiya&lt;/a&gt; (1989), lan menangaké &lt;a href="Filmfare%20Best%20Male%20Debut%20Award"&gt;Filmfare Best Male Debut Award&lt;/a&gt;. Khan uga main ing sawatara filem Bollywood paling suksès, kaya déné &lt;a href="Saajan"&gt;Saajan&lt;/a&gt; (1991), &lt;a href="Hum%20Aapke%20Hain%20Kaun"&gt;Hum Aapke Hain Kaun&lt;/a&gt; (1994), &lt;a href="Biwi%20No.1"&gt;Biwi No.1&lt;/a&gt; (1999).
Ing taun 1999, Khan menangaké &lt;a href="Filmfare%20Best%20Supporting%20Actor%20Award"&gt;Filmfare Best Supporting Actor Award&lt;/a&gt; ngenani aktingé ing &lt;a href="Kuch%20Kuch%20Hota%20Hai"&gt;Kuch Kuch Hota Hai&lt;/a&gt; (1998), lan wiwit iku Khan ngraih suksès sajeroning filem-filem &lt;a href="Hum%20Dil%20De%20Chuke%20Sanam"&gt;Hum Dil De Chuke Sanam&lt;/a&gt; (1999), &lt;a href="Tere%20Naam"&gt;Tere Naam&lt;/a&gt; (2003), &lt;a href="No%20Entry"&gt;No Entry&lt;/a&gt; (2005) lan &lt;a href="Partner%20%282007%20filem%29"&gt;Partner&lt;/a&gt; (2007). 
